Changes
The Rewind-CUA harness is original code under libs/rewind-cua/ (MIT, copyright
2026 zysen1). REWIND.md documents it in English and Chinese. Those additions
do not relicense the upstream tree.

Rewind-CUA adds an append-only action journal, workspace checkpoints and
rewind, a YAML action policy, and uncertainty escalation to a stronger model
or a person. The snapshot notes in libs/rewind-cua/docs/SNAPSHOTS.md describe
the QEMU and Lume mechanisms this harness can call, and the ones it does not
treat as named rewind points.
